{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09381","headline":"同元锡题琅瑘寺 · 韦应物","name":"同元锡题琅瑘寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"适从郡邑喧，又兹三伏热。\n山中清景多，石罅寒泉洁。\n花香天界事，松竹人间别。\n殿分岚岭明，磴临悬壑绝。\n昏旭穷陟降，幽显尽披阅。\n嶔骇风雨区，寒知龙蛇穴。\n情虚澹泊生，境寂尘妄灭。\n经世岂非道，无爲厌车辙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09381.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09381","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}